cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the software and the article it belongs to."
title: "GlycA and ischemic stroke: two-sample Mendelian randomization pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Fully scripted, seeded R pipeline (TwoSampleMR, MR-PRESSO, MVMR, mr.raps) estimating the causal
  effect of circulating glycoprotein acetyls (GlycA) on ischemic stroke and its subtypes in
  MEGASTROKE and GIGASTROKE, with multivariable MR, power analysis, robustness, atrial-fibrillation
  and reverse-direction analyses, plus independent Python re-implementations of the estimators.
type: software
